    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγένν-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεννάὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unbegotten, unborn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τότ᾽ ἦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					973
				</span></i>
			: <i>unoriginated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				52a
			</span></i>. Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναιτίως καὶ
			ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1015b
			</span></i> codd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>non-existent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγεννής</span>
			, <i>low-born, mean</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not productive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.10.1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without leaving issue,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epigr.Gr.
					333a
				</span></i>
			 (Perg.).</div>
